SUMMARY:Flourish: A Transformational Day Retreat in the Blue Ridge Mountai
 ns
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**A paid\, full-day retreat held in a bea
 utiful temple on the stunning mountain grounds of Compassionate Expression
 s in Leicester\, North Carolina. [LEARN MORE & REGISTER HERE.](https://www
 .eventbrite.com/e/flourish-a-transformational-day-retreat-in-the-blue-ridg
 e-mountains-registration-1984650601374?aff=ebdsoporgprofile)**\n\n***\\*Ea
 rlybird Discount: Use code "FLOURISH" before April 4th to receive $30 off 
 your ticket***\n\nSurrounded by open skies and sweeping mountain views\, t
 his day retreat is an invitation to step out of the busy pace of life and 
 into something more spacious through the exploration of movement\, breath\
 , sound\, ritual\, and connection.\n\n**The Flow of Your Experience:**\n\n
 * An opening circle to arrive\, ground\, and set intentions for the day\n*
  Qoya-inspired movement to awaken and reconnect with your body\n* A shared
  nourishing midday meal with organic\, local ingredients\, prepared by a p
 rivate chef\n* Guided circular breathwork with Reiki support to release te
 nsion\, restore balance\, and deepen presence\n* An intricate sound healin
 g journey with crystal bowls\, gongs\, chimes\, ocean drums\, and other th
 erapeutic instruments\n* Time outdoors on the mountain grounds for a speci
 al planting intention ritual\n* A closing circle to share and honor what y
 ou’re carrying forward\n\n*Note: There will be pockets of integration sp
 ace throughout the day to journal\, reflect\, and connect with others*
