SUMMARY:A Group Mediumship Reading with Mary Stevens
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nCome join in a group experience as we con
 nect with our loved ones in the Spirit world. During our time together we 
 will create a safe\, supportive space for ourselves as a way to strengthen
  the communication link.\n\nThere will be time for both readings and Q&A. 
 Please remember\, since Spirit chooses who comes forward to visit\, not ev
 eryone in the group may receive an individual reading. However\, everyone 
 still benefits! Individual messages from the Spirit world contain words of
  universal wisdom that can resonate with and serve as guidance for all of 
 us!\n\nA mediumship reading can be a gateway for a meaningful connection b
 etween you and your loved one in the spirit world. It can be an opportunit
 y for exploration\, discovery\, and learning. If you have never participat
 ed in a mediumship reading or want to learn more about mediumship\, this i
 s a great opportunity to do so.\n\nPrice: $25 (Cash\, Card\, Venmo)\n\nMar
 y has a background as a grief counselor for hospice and is also a retired 
 Naturopathic Physician. She has over 25 years of experience using her intu
 ition in her work with clients. She now lends this knowledge and skill to 
 her role as a medium. She has Certificates of Completion in Evidential Med
 iumship and Biofield Balance Intuitive Assessments.\n\nMeet Mary at our In
 tuition Open House
