SUMMARY:Gemini Sun Circles with Senseful Wellness
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an ene
 rgetic shift occurs. Learning to connect\, listen\, and set intentions wit
 h the sun is a beautiful way to add ritual into your life.\n\nGemini seaso
 n is from 5/20-6/20 and for this gathering we'll discuss the Astrological 
 happenings of the zodiac season and where it will impact you personally (b
 irth chart recommended).\n\nAs with all energetic shifts\, getting into yo
 ur body is important. Together we'll ground into the energy through medita
 tion and movement themed around the season. Accommodations/Modification ca
 n be made for ALL bodies\, come as you are.\n\nWe'll close out with time f
 or journaling and optional sharing.\n\nPrice: $11
